00:56:21.046 --> 00:56:22.848
Penelope Rogers.

00:56:22.982 --> 00:56:24.550
[Frank menghela napas]

00:56:24.683 --> 00:56:26.585
Oh, seperti Ginger Rogers?

00:56:27.086 --> 00:56:28.486
[tertawa kecil]

00:56:28.621 --> 00:56:31.657
Ya. Saya mengerti.

00:56:34.727 --> 00:56:37.730
Seperti apa rasanya bercinta
sebelum kecelakaan itu?

00:56:42.034 --> 00:56:43.434
