00:56:44.303 --> 00:56:45.838
Bersifat vulkanik.

00:56:47.306 --> 00:56:48.908
Ledakan Besar.

00:56:49.041 --> 00:56:51.810
Sinar matahari.

00:56:52.912 --> 00:56:54.747
Manisan.

00:56:57.616 --> 00:56:59.417
Itu sungguh luar biasa.

00:57:09.695 --> 00:57:11.697
Menurutmu dia baik-baik saja?

00:57:13.098 --> 00:57:14.934
Pria dari kereta itu?

00:57:17.803 --> 00:57:19.738
