00:57:20.471 --> 00:57:21.573
Bagus.

00:57:23.642 --> 00:57:27.846
-Ya.
-[Frank terengah-engah, mengerang]

00:57:31.884 --> 00:57:33.419
Kamu baik-baik saja? Hmm?

00:57:33.552 --> 00:57:35.821
Sarafku.
Terkadang itu sulit...

00:57:35.955 --> 00:57:37.022
[terkejut]

00:57:37.156 --> 00:57:39.858
