01:04:42.582 --> 01:04:45.217
-[para tamu terkejut]
-[Frank mendengus]

01:04:49.221 --> 01:04:52.658
[tertawa] Ya Tuhan. Sialan.

01:04:52.792 --> 01:04:55.427
[Frank terus mendengus]

01:05:02.467 --> 01:05:06.405
