"Puttin' On The Ritz" diputar]

01:05:11.943 --> 01:05:13.178
[para tamu terkejut]

01:05:25.758 --> 01:05:27.492
Ya, Frankie!

01:05:27.627 --> 01:05:29.662
[keduanya mendengus]

01:05:50.716 --> 01:05:54.252
-[Frank berteriak]
-[Pengantin Wanita] Sayang!

01:06:07.700 --> 01:06:08.734
