01:07:15.066 --> 01:07:16.836
[Pengantin Wanita]
Apa yang kamu lakukan di sini?

01:07:17.502 --> 01:07:19.337
[Wiles] Ya Tuhan.

01:07:21.507 --> 01:07:22.575
Frankie!

01:07:22.708 --> 01:07:24.911
Frankie! Frankie,
kita harus keluar...

01:07:25.043 --> 01:07:29.281
Berpakaian ala Ritz!

01:07:30.315 --> 01:07:32.117
[keduanya mendengus]

01:07:34.020 --> 01:07:35.287
Tunggu!

01:07:35.420 --> 01:07:37.489
[tamu] Petugas, petugas.
Tahan, tahan.

01:07:37.623 --> 01:07:39.057
-Berhenti!
