Buang saja.

01:07:47.065 --> 01:07:48.534
Biarkan dia pergi.

01:07:51.037 --> 01:07:52.437
Lepaskan dia!

01:07:58.443 --> 01:08:00.613
[para tamu tersentak kaget, berteriak]

01:08:04.584 --> 01:08:05.651
Bergerak.

01:08:06.184 --> 01:08:07.419
Bergerak!

