01:09:17.089 --> 01:09:22.394
Tuan Vito Lupino, bos mafia,
pembunuh wanita.

01:09:23.095 --> 01:09:25.397
Elsie, Lucy, May,

01:09:26.899 --> 01:09:28.199
Rae,

